Map a bounded code-to-cloud entity neighborhood

Usage:
  eshu map --from <thing> [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string        API key for authentication
      --depth int             Maximum relationship depth to traverse (default 1)
      --env string            Environment selector used to narrow runtime/resource relationships
      --from string           Entity handle to map, such as terraform/aws_lb.main or workload:checkout
  -h, --help                  help for map
      --json                  Write the canonical entity map envelope as JSON
      --limit int             Maximum mapped relationships to return (default 25)
      --profile string        Config profile name
      --relationship string   Relationship type filter, such as DEPENDS_ON or PROVISIONS_DEPENDENCY_FOR
      --repo string           Repository selector used to narrow resolution
      --service-url string    API service URL (overrides config)
      --type string           Entity type hint such as service, repository, terraform_resource, k8s_resource, or file

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
